      <h2>Built Around Real Problems</h2>
      <p>
        Odderon Lab is an independent hardware lab creating small, focused tools for
        engineers, technicians, makers, and technically obsessive people. The work
        starts with a real problem, a bench prototype, and the question: is there a
        simpler way to do this?
      </p>
      <p>
        The name comes from the odderon, a rare physics phenomenon detected through
        subtle interactions. The same idea guides the work here: pay attention to
        the small signals, awkward edge cases, and failures that are easy to miss.
      </p>
